DTSTART:20260211T033000Z
DTEND:20260211T052000Z
DTSTAMP:20260211T033000Z
UID:NgnBl69vUT
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 93 mins (1h33m)\n\n2029: A female cybernetic governm
 ent agent\, Major Motoko Kusanagi\, and the Internal Bureau of Investigati
 ons are hot on the trail of “The Puppet Master\,” a mysterious and thr
 eatening computer virus capable of infiltrating human hosts. A co-presenta
 tion with Brain Dead and Glasswing. A panel discussion to follow the scree
 ning.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/ghost-in-the-shell\n\nEst
 imated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
