 shapes and controls lives. A lawyer (Daniel Day-Lewis) is set to marry a w
 ealthy socialite (Winona Ryder)\, when he falls in love with an outsider (
 Michelle Pfeiffer). Secret love expressed with flowers\, and a glove eroti
 cally removed. Scorsese the romantic.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and
 -events/martin-scorsese/the-age-of-innocence\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
